{t: Chameleon}
{st: Herbie Hancock}
{key: Bbm}
{tempo: 104}

{sot: Head}
| Bbm7        | Eb7         | Bbm7        | Eb7         |
| Bbm7        | Eb7         | Bbm7        | Eb7         |
{eot}

{sot: Solo}
| Bbm9        | Db7sus4     | Bbm9        | Db7sus4     |
